        "date": "2026-11-23T03:48:48Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(3d): Pass starts at on 3D Pocket\n\n3D Pocket gets the shared pass_start field (#3316): params, project\nkey (absent = Auto, no version step), digest off Auto, the Passes-tab\nrow and the generic MCP edit_operation. Inside and Outside force the\nring order of Waterline and Offset rings through the 2D ring law\n(machining2d::level_ring_plan). Auto keeps plan_passes byte for byte.\nZigzag, Auto rows, Adaptive HSM and the rest pass keep their order and\nsay so by name.\n\nFixes #3361\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
